abstract: "A frozen 20-task audit of 4-bit Gemma 4 E2B repository patching. Single-shot 0/20 strict; retrieval plus one repair 6/20 strict (0 verified passes, 1 tested failure, 5 unverified); fresh split 0/20. A 14B Qwen comparison case produces one test-verified edit (seaborn-3010), not a scale result."
